  "notes": [
    "-IR verb; all tenses are regular EXCEPT the past participle",
    "Irregular past participle: **cubierto** (used in all compound tenses: he cubierto, había cubierto, etc.)",
    "*cubrir algo con algo* = to cover something with something (*Cubrió la herida con una venda* — He covered the wound with a bandage)",
    "*cubrirse* (reflexive) = to cover oneself (*Cúbrete con la manta* — Cover yourself with the blanket)",
    "Related: *descubrir* (to discover/uncover — also has irregular PP: *descubierto*)"
  ],
